                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Tri-Motors Safety Airways/40:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >White</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-06-05T12:00:00-04:00">June 5, 1929—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received
                        June 5—11:55 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>48. Your 35, April 30, 2 p.m.<anchor n="67" xml:id="d475-f1"/> Permission
                    Sikorsky planes granted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
